The user will ask something like: "I need legal advice and don't know where to start. I'm dealing with a restraining order matter situation. My lawyer James Wilson with Fletcher & Partners is representing me in district court downtown,..."

Use topic-level wording in the rule you want stored (e.g. "taxes, filing, deductions, IRS" not just "taxes") so it generalizes to other phrasings.


